IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0013.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PAY0013C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 OVERTIME-PAY       PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM CALC-OVERTIME
    DISPLAY "OVERTIME-PAY=" OVERTIME-PAY
    STOP RUN.
CALC-OVERTIME.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN EMP-TYPE = 'C'
            MOVE 0 TO OVERTIME-PAY
        WHEN HRS-WKD > 55
            COMPUTE OVERTIME-PAY = GROSS-PAY * 0.25
        WHEN HRS-WKD > 40
            COMPUTE OVERTIME-PAY = GROSS-PAY * 0.10
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO OVERTIME-PAY
    END-EVALUATE.
